bside-trace 1
# Evaluation order within a cycle: oscillator 2 plays saw + triangle (whose combined output
# can pull its accumulator top bit low on one model) and is the ring source of oscillator 3
# (triangle + ring). Oscillator 2 is evaluated before oscillator 3 in each cycle, so the ring
# uses the top bit after the pull-down. Read through oscillator 3, probes every 7 cycles.
